      "snippet": {
        "line": 249,
        "text": "inverseCoeff d a k := multiplier d k * a k, multiplier d k = (omega * (symbol d k : ℂ))⁻¹, omega = 2*π*I, symbol .temporal k = k₁(v_t)₁ + k₂(v_t)₂ (symbol_formula); inverseCoeff_zero gives the k = 0 term 0"
